          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新的說明頁逐項解釋「看不到的空間」每一行，以及為什麼和系統設定的數字不一樣。從「說明」選單打開。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new page explains every line of Unaccounted Space and why its numbers differ from Storage settings. Open it from the Help menu."
          }
