    "每組保留路徑排序最前面的一份，其餘丟到垃圾桶；會先列出項目讓你確認。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep the first copy in path order in each group and move the rest to Trash; review the list before confirming."
          }
